[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4327869164","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118972#issuecomment-4327869164","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118972","id":4327869164,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAfYK7A","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-27T14:39:10Z","updated_at":"2026-04-27T14:39:10Z","body":"> Additionally, when getting the data of whether a tab is or isn't hidden and/or disabled, depending on what script does it, the output is different when running in editor. If the script is on the TabContainer node itself, they always report those options are set to false, when higher up, they report it correctly, but only when running in editor.\n\nThe reason is that these properties are initialized when the TabContainer itself is ready (because it relies on child nodes). You will get correct results if you print the info in a deferred call (script's `_ready()` is called before TabContainer's interanal ready callback).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4327869164/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4329841308","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118972#issuecomment-4329841308","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118972","id":4329841308,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAhQinA","user":{"login":"lajawi","id":51792807,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkyODA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51792807?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi","html_url":"https://github.com/lajawi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-27T19:27:45Z","updated_at":"2026-04-27T19:27:45Z","body":"@KoBeWi, indeed, a deferred call fixed what I that part. The reason I mentioned it was because I wanted to use it as a way of testing and communicating the outcome.\n\nWhat bewilders me is why the script on the scene root *can* correctly say which tabs are and aren't hidden and/or disabled? Doesn't it load in before the `TabContainer` too? Or is initialization from deepest child to root, opposed to root to deepest child? If so, why wouldn't the script on the `TabContainer` work correctly?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4329841308/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4329847213","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118972#issuecomment-4329847213","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118972","id":4329847213,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAhQ5rQ","user":{"login":"lajawi","id":51792807,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkyODA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51792807?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi","html_url":"https://github.com/lajawi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-27T19:28:49Z","updated_at":"2026-04-27T19:28:49Z","body":"Thanks for the pull request, I'll happily wait to see this fix get implemented! 🎉 ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4329847213/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/re